Thank you for your interest in the SkySplat series of papers. 
The full codebase will be released once the extended version of the paper is accepted. 
In the meantime, we will gradually share our refined general-purpose 3D Gaussian Splatting methods, including **MVSplat** and **HiSplat**.  

Project webpage: [SkySplatV2](https://nancheng2001.github.io/SkySplatV2/)

